### 聊天消息 / QQ 桥
### GET 无需鉴权；POST 若配置了 http_auth 需 Bearer / X-DB-Token

### 查询消息
# @name messagesList
GET {{dbBase}}/api/sfmc/messages

### 按频道 / 类型 / 关键词过滤
# @name messagesFilter
GET {{dbBase}}/api/sfmc/messages?channelId={{bridgeChannelId}}&type=text&search=hello

### 时间范围（毫秒）
# @name messagesByTime
GET {{dbBase}}/api/sfmc/messages?minCreatedAt=1700000000000&maxCreatedAt=1900000000000

### 写入消息（最多 100 条；可能触发 MC→QQ）
# @name messagesPost
POST {{dbBase}}/api/sfmc/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{httpAuth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "rest-client-demo-1",
      "channelId": "{{bridgeChannelId}}",
      "fromid": "player-uuid",
      "fromName": "Steve",
      "type": "text",
      "content": "hello from REST Client",
      "attachment": null,
      "showTimestamp": true,
      "timestamp": 1721548800000
    }
  ]
}

### 模拟 qq-bridge → db-server（QQ→MC）
# @name messagesFromQq
POST {{dbBase}}/api/sfmc/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{httpAuth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "qq_123456_1721548800000",
      "channelId": "{{bridgeChannelId}}",
      "fromid": "qq_123456",
      "fromName": "Nickname",
      "type": "text",
      "content": "hello from QQ",
      "showTimestamp": true,
      "timestamp": 1721548800000
    }
  ]
}
